<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 6.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Wednesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali gets from Education Minister Hatem Ben Othman first report of committee in charge of introducing teaching of human rights in schools.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- President gets message from Ghana's President Rawlings.</p>
<p>LE RENOUVEAU</p>
<p>- Symposium in Tunis supports project to set up Mediterranean organisation for dialogue and cooperation.</p>
</text>
